  "details": "I'm really hoping when age verification is made free for UK users that facial age estimation'll be an option. For context, I can't do mobile phone verification because I don't have a contract phone, I can't do credit card verification because I'm not eligible, and I DEFINITELY ain't doing ID card verification given the multiple leaks that've happened with several age verification providers. Doing a quick face scan using my phone is the only option that seems to have worked for me in the past, and I'm utterly terrified of losing contact with my friend group on VRChat when the laws here in the UK start restricting platforms like VRChat even more.",
